     "city_en": "Ismailia",
     "city_ar": "الإسماعيلية",
     "region_en": null,
     "bio_en": "REACT – Revitalizing Environments through Adaptive City Transformation is a social-impact startup working at the intersection of urban development, heritage, research, innovation, and community empowerment. It develops research-based and practical solutions for sustainable urban transformation while creating opportunities for collaboration between professionals, researchers, students, institutions, and local communities.\n\nReismailia is REACT’s flagship community initiative, focusing on the revitalization of Ismailia through heritage awareness, documentation, research, education, community engagement, and cultural activities. As the social/community arm, Reismailia organizes workshops, lectures, heritage walks, surveys, awareness campaigns, and research activities that connect people with the city’s tangible and intangible heritage.\n\nTogether, REACT provides the entrepreneurial and professional platform, while Reismailia drives the community and social impact, turning research and ideas into initiatives that contribute to Ismailia’s identity, heritage, and future development.",
